OL,3,GNEWSACouncil given #1.6m grant to
OL,4,Atackle rough sleeping
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #1.6m government grant will help
OL,7,Fprovide safe accommodation for rough
OL,8,Fsleepers in Leeds by Christmas, the
OL,9,Fcity council has said.
OL,11,FThe funding is from the government's
OL,12,Fnational Rough Sleeping Programme
OL,13,Fannounced in summer, a three-year
OL,14,Fprogramme of support.
OL,16,FThe council said charities and
OL,17,Fvoluntary organisations would be able
OL,18,Fto give more help to people sleeping on
OL,19,Fthe streets or at risk of homelessness.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
