OL,3,GNEWSACouncil given #1.6m grant to
OL,4,Atackle rough sleeping
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts report added: "This funding will be
OL,7,Fused for immediate interventions to
OL,8,Fensure all those rough sleeping have an
OL,9,Foffer of accommodation by Christmas and
OL,10,Fsupport longer-term sustainment of
OL,11,Faccommodation."
